"""Question bank for the BB 101 end-sem practice PDF.

Types
  mcq    single correct              o: 4 options, a: index
  multi  one or more correct         o: options,  a: list of indices
  match  match the columns           L, R: columns, a: index into R for each L (R may hold a distractor)
  fill   fill in the blanks          q uses ____ for each blank, a: list of answers
  tf     true / false                a: True/False, e: correction / reason
  ar     assertion–reason            A, R, a: 0..3 (see AR_KEY)
  order  arrange in order            items, a: indices of items in the correct order
  num    numerical / problem         a: final answer (html), w: working
  short  short answer                a: model answer (html)
Any question may carry 'fig' (html shown under the stem) and 'r' (Campbell 10th ed. section).
"""

